# Applies only to builds whose context is the repository root. Several images
# have one, because they reach outside their own service directory:
# eudi-adapter, dev-portal-backend and openftv-pdp bake in ./policies, and the
# services that write Logboek Dataverwerkingen records depend on the sibling
# services/ldv-client module.
#
# Deliberately conservative: it lists only what no root-context Dockerfile
# copies and what is large or secret. The nl-wallet submodule is the reason it
# exists at all — without this every root-context build shipped it as context.
# Anything a Dockerfile needs must NOT be listed here.
.git
.claude
vendor
.local
**/node_modules
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
.env
fsc-infra/.env
